# CommonProject repository contract
.env
.env.*
!.env.op
/.agents/local.json
# Skillex-synced skills are inherited, not source -- ignore them.
# EXCEPT the two that ARE this project's product: under AD-1 there is no
# application tier, so the skills are the deliverable, and AD-10 requires them
# committed (a skill left in the profile's disposable dir dies on rebuild).
# Note the trailing /* -- git will not descend into a wholly-excluded directory,
# so a bare `/.agents/skills` would make the negations below dead letters.
# The first line overrides the machine-wide `.agents/skills/` exclude in
# ~/.agents/git/ignore -- git will not descend into a wholly-excluded directory,
# so without it the negations below are dead letters.
!/.agents/skills/
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/trivia-video/
!/.agents/skills/carries-house-style/
!/.agents/skills/tiktok/
